        "description_1": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {
            "description": "<p>Fairweather makes caps, tees and crewnecks in heavy cotton, a few colours at a time. We started with one cap and a borrowed embroidery machine, and we still make every run in the same small workshop.</p>",
